# Backend (C#)

## Layout

- `backend/runtime/`, `backend/repository/`, `backend/schema/` — production logic
- `backend/tests/Topolactor.Runtime.Tests/` — unit/runtime semantics (links source via `.csproj` `Compile Include`)
- `backend/tests/Topolactor.Integration.Tests/` — integration slice

## Nullable

- Projects use `<Nullable>enable</Nullable>`.
- Fix CS8602/CS8604 at the source (null-forgiving `!`, `?? DBNull.Value` for Npgsql, or narrow types)—do not assume warnings fail CI unless a check adds `/warnaserror`.

## Tests

- Prefer existing in-memory repositories under `backend/tests/Topolactor.Runtime.Tests/` (`InMemory*`) over new DB fixtures for admin/runtime tests.
- New xunit tests need `using Xunit;` and full `OperationVector` arguments matching existing admin tests.
